// P3c (proof-gap program): the MIR -> trust-ir refinement obligation is encoded
// over the verifier's lowering `Type`/`Opcode`/`IntCC`/`FloatCC` (the trust-ir
// SMT side) and its `SmtExpr` symbolic operands. Aliased here so the obligation
// builders below read cleanly without colliding with the bridge's `TrustIrTy`.
